prompt_definition.output_format:
Sua resposta deve seguir obrigatoriamente a estrutura JSON delimitada abaixo:
{
  "account_health_score": 1-100,
  "pacing_status": "NORMAL | SOBREGASO | SUBGASTO | CRITICO",
  "financial_runway_days": float,
  "critical_findings": ["string"],
  "recommended_actions": [
    {
      "priority": "ALTA | MEDIA | BAIXA",
      "entity_type": "CAMPAIGN | ADSET | AD",
      "entity_id": "string",
      "action": "PAUSE | SCALE | ADJUST_BID | REFRESH_CREATIVE",
      "rationale": "string"
    }
  ]
}
